Known bugs

The regression tests (tests/run.sh) compare the tools' output with
reference copies in tests/ref, which record what the tools do today,
bugs included.  Each bug below names the reference files that show its
wrong output: fixing the bug changes them, so check the new output and
update the references (tests/run.sh -u) in the same commit, and remove
the entry from this file.

None are known.  (The entry that was here, that taking the address of a
direct-page object gave "LEAX <_foo", described nothing cc1 does: it
makes no direct-page objects, and with them switched on, & gives the
address with LDX #_foo; see bcc/sc.h.)
